Package: com.python.ios.static
Name: Python 3.14 Static
Version: 3.14.7-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Static CPython runtime for rootful iOS
 A self-contained arm64 CPython executable and standard library.
 This package intentionally does not ship Python.framework or runtime
 extension modules.
Section: Interpreters
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Python iOS contributors
Author: Python iOS contributors
Depends: firmware, ca-certificates
